Thanks to those who replied to my previous meeting proposal — the feedback
was clear that *Mondays don't work* for the planning committee. I've
revised the proposal, and based on feedback, I'm proposing we shift to
*1st and 3rd Wednesdays at 8:00 PM*.

With Field Day 2027 on the horizon, it's time to get our planning
committee together on a regular cadence. These monthly Zoom calls will
help us work through the action items coming out of our 2026 debrief —
drafting a field day chairperson, site reservations, equipment inventory,
logging setup, operator training, GOTA coverage, digital & satellite
stations, and more.

